msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake-lock.md:42
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake-lock.md:44
msgid ""
"This command updates the lock file of a flake (`flake.lock`) so that it "
"contains an up-to-date lock for every flake input specified in `flake.nix`. "
"Lock file entries are already up-to-date are not modified."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake-lock.md:48
msgid ""
"If you want to update existing lock entries, use [`nix flake update`](../../"
"command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake-update.md)"
msgstr ""

